ace-relative partial-publication details (without `AbsPath` or raw content leakage) propagate through `toolset.commitOutcome`, `Loop.Run`, and `callbackDispatcher.Call` into persisted `session_messages` for identical `Resume` (`R4-02-D`). Unsupported filesystems (e.g. macOS exFAT) fail cleanly with `CodeUnsupportedFilesystem` (`R3-01`); private temp removal is best-effort (`R3-02`, open P3). `CommitReceipt` exports `Committed`, `DirtyFailure`, `State`, and `filepath.ToSlash`-normalized `[]FileCommitReceipt`.
